Sun Nov 15 07:22:04 UTC 2026 - Fridrich Strba <fstrba@suse.com>

- Upgrade to upstream version 4.2.0
  * Highlights
    + Deleting a tree no longer deletes outside it. FileUtils
      .forceDeleteOnExit followed symbolic links to directories, so
      a link inside the tree got every file under its target deleted
      when the JVM exited. deleteDirectory could empty a link's
      target when the link itself could not be removed. Both now
      remove only the link.
    + Child processes can read the console. When CommandLineUtils
      .executeCommandLine gets System.in as the process input, it
      now polls it instead of blocking in read(), so the call
      returns once the process exits rather than hanging on an idle
      terminal.
    + translateCommandline splits at tabs and line breaks. Outside
      quotes, \t, \n and \r now separate arguments like a space
      does. Input that held one of these characters unquoted now
      yields more arguments; quoted text is unchanged.
    + Clearer FileUtils failures. forceDelete uses Files
      .deleteIfExists, so it also removes dangling symbolic links
      and skips the Windows retry delay for files that are already
      gone. copyDirectoryStructure and cleanDirectoryOnExit report
      an unreadable directory as an IOException naming it, instead
      of a NullPointerException.
  * New features and improvements
    + Poll System.in for stdin in CommandLineUtils
      .executeCommandLine
  * Bug Fixes
    + Do not follow symlinks in forceDeleteOnExit and
      deleteDirectory
    + Split translateCommandline at tabs and line breaks
    + Use Files.deleteIfExists in FileUtils.forceDelete
    + Report an unlistable directory as IOException instead of
      NullPointerException
  * Documentation updates
    + Drop the Source Xref menu item
    + Stop pinning a version in the README snippet
    + Advertise 4.1.0 in the README
  * Build
    + Allow running the release drafter by hand
    + Draft the version the labels imply, not always a patch
  * Dependency updates
    + Bump plexus-xml to 3.1.1 and keep Dependabot on 3.x
    + Bump release-drafter/release-drafter from 7.7.0 to 7.10.0

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Fri Sep 11 05:46:51 UTC 2026 - Fridrich Strba <fstrba@suse.com>

- Upgrade to upstream version 4.1.0
  * Breaking changes
    + Do not exclude ".gitignore" and ".cvsignore" by default
  * Maintenance
    + Rewrite README with usage, status and version guidance
  * Build
    + Update parent to plexus 27
    + Drop the Publish Site workflow
    + Add the Publish Site workflow
    + Use the shared release-drafter config instead of a local copy
  * Dependency updates
    + Bump the plexus dependencies released today
    + Bump org.codehaus.plexus:plexus from 25 to 26
    + Bump release-drafter/release-drafter from 7 to 7.7.0
- Changes of version 4.0.3
  * New features and improvements
    + Add Automatic-Module-Name manifest entry
    + V4 changes to make external usage easier
  * Bug Fixes
    + Fix Zip Slip vulnerability in archive extraction
  * Maintenance
    + Move to Site 2.0 descriptor
    + JUnit Jupiter best practices & code cleanups
    + Replace FileUtils.fileExists(String) with JDK provided API
    + Declare license info in POM
    + Cleanup tests
  * Dependency updates
    + Bump release-drafter/release-drafter from 6 to 7
    + Bump org.codehaus.plexus:plexus from 18 to 25
- Removed patch:
  * plexus-utils-CVE-2025-67030.patch
    + not needed with this version; integrated upstream

